{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30125","headline":"上翰林丁学士 · 刘得仁","name":"上翰林丁学士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今代如尧代，徵贤察衆情。\n久聆推行寔，然後佐聪明。\n官自文华重，恩因顾问生。\n词人求作称，天子许和羹。\n御柳凋霜晚，宫泉滴月清。\n直庐寒漏近，秋烛白麻成。\n玉殿移时对，金舆数侍行。\n赐衣香未散，借马色难名。\n时辈何偏羡，儒流此最荣。\n终当闻夑理，寰宇永昇平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘得仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30125.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30125","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}